  "quests": [
    {
      "ID": "38818",
      "LogTitle": "'The Final Judgment'",
      "LogDescription": "'Defeat Runeseer Faljar in Haustvald.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'In my fragmented state, I captured glimpses of a hero meting out justice to the corrupted mystics of Haustvald. I see now, this hero was you, $c. \\n\\nI know you seek my judgment, but my spirit is still fragmented. As we speak,  Runeseer Faljar is calling upon dark, forbidden magics in an attempt to banish my spirit to Helheim. If he succeeds, your trial will be lost.\\n\\nMy connection here is fading. Go, there is little time!'",
      "Flags": "39845896",
      "FlagsEx": "0",
      "RewardNextQuest": "0"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38815",
      "LogTitle": "'Waking the Shieldmaiden'",
      "LogDescription": "'Use the Rune of Reformation to return Ashildir\\'s spirit to her bones.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'With the rituals disrupted and her bones returned, we may be able to wrest Ashildir from the grasp of these Bonespeakers.\\n\\nDeeper within Haustvald, the mystics possess a special altar that can reunite the body and spirit of a fallen warrior. With this, we may be able to return Ashildir\\'s spirit into her bones, and out of the grasp of these foul mystics.\\n\\nGo outsider, I will rally her guard.'",
      "Flags": "33554440",
      "FlagsEx": "0",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38818"
    }
  ],
